  "text_md": "![](<0722235b45282fd9c4b9d92efc9dbf6e9704d798_page_2_processed_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n# )\n\nTHE FACULTY OF SOCIAL SCIENCES of the University of the West Indies is pleased to be associated with the Institute of Caribbean Studies at the UWI Mona, in presenting the Conference on Caribbean Culture, in honour of distinguished Caribbean Scholar, Professor Rex Nettleford.\n\nPLEI'tARY SFEAKERS ll'ICWDE\n\nGeorge Lamming\n\nKamau Braithwaite Stuart Hall\n\nCoiwEREI'!CE LAI'KlUAGE\n\nThe conference will be opened on Sunday, March 3, 1996 by the Rt. Hon. Michael Manley, P.C., and closes with an address by the honoree on Wednesday, March 6, at 8 pm.\n\nEnglish\n\nf.:VEI'W'Kl PROGRAM\n\nPerformance by NDTC Cocktail Reception\n\n# PROG RAMMEcDRAFT)\n\nAccomtODA1101'1 DJ:TAILS\n\nThe Jamaica Pegasus\n\nSUnday, March 3, Official opening by Rt. Hon. Michael Manley, P.C. 7 pm Venue: Phillip Sherlock Centre\n\nStandard rooms (standard or double occupancy) Executive rooms (standard or double occupancy) Junior suites (standard or double occupancy)\n\nus$ 85.00\n\nus$130.00\n\nMonday, March 4th\n\nus$175.00\n\nSocial Science Lecture Theatre (SSLT)\n\nPlenary\n\n- 9am\n- 10:00 am 10:30. 12:30 12:30 · 2 pm 2 · 3.30 pm 4-6 pm\n\n\nf.:dge Hill Luxury Apartments\n\nCoffee Break Panels' Lunch Panels' Panels'\n\nus$ 55.00\n\nStudio units\n\nMayfair Hotel\n\nus$51.25 us$61.25\n\nSingle Standard Room Single Superior Room Double Superior Room\n\nus$51.25 us$88.76\n\nTuesday March 5th.\n\nI Bedroom Suite\n\nPlenary Social Science Lecture Theatre (SSLT)\n\n- 9am\n- 10:00 am 10:30 . 12:30 12:30 · 2 pm 2 · 3.30 pm 4-6 pm\n\n\nDouble Superior Suite US $125.00\n\nCoffee Break Panels' Lunch\n\nSenior Common Room. UWI Mona\n\n(Very limited accommodation, prices subject to change)\n\nSingle occupancy US$35.00 per night Double occupancy US $50.00 per night\n\nPanels' Panels'\n\nWyndham Kingston\n\nWednesday March 6th.\n\nus$80.00\n\nSingle/double occupancy\n\nSocial Science Lecture Theatre (SSLT)\n\nPlenary\n\n- 9am\n- 10:00 am 10:30 . 12:30 12:30-2 pm 2 · 3.30 pm 5:30pm 8 pm\n\n\nAll prices include tax and service charges\n\nCoffee Break Panels' Lunch Panels' Panel Closing address Venue\n\nConference attendees traveling from the U.S. via Air Jamaica are eligible for special fares. To inquire about these rates or make reservations, please advise your Air Jamaica representative to use record 'WCULTURE:'.\n\nHon. Rex Nettleford Phillip Sherlock Centre\n\n• Three panels will be running simultaneously.\n\n## I\n\n",
